note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Session epoch advances only after confirmed teardown; MAX permanently refuses reopen.
note Pure scalar binding: no host words, mutable globals, stack arena or runtime imports.
fn native_epoch previous ulong to ulong
if eq previous 18446744073709551615
ret 18446744073709551615
end
ret add previous 1
end
